  "html": "\n<div align=\"center\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"630\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td height=\"10\" width=\"630\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><a name=\"top\"></a></span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/memo_t.gif\" height=\"25\" width=\"630\"> <p><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"24\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/u.gif\" width=\"24\">O. \n                            Combat&amp;Jobs</b></span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/memo_m.gif\" height=\"39\" width=\"630\"> <p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:60%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolordark=\"#666666\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"600\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/alpha_background_1.gif\" height=\"22\">\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" bordercolordark=\"#666666\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"590\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/alpha_background.gif\">\n<p><font color=\"black\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"\" bordercolor=\"#999933\" bordercolordark=\"#A0965A\" bordercolorlight=\"#999933\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"550\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/alpha_background_2.gif\" colspan=\"3\" height=\"25\" width=\"540\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;■ 해부학 스킬에 \n\n                        따른 메시지 분석표</span></b></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"28\" width=\"247\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">스킬에 \n                                        따른 표시 (덱스)</span></font></p></td>\n<td height=\"28\" width=\"225\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">스킬에 \n                                        따른 표시 (체력)</span></font></p></td>\n<td height=\"28\" width=\"56\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Stats</span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"28\" width=\"247\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"거의 \n                                        서있기도 힘듭니다.\"</span></font></p></td>\n<td height=\"28\" width=\"225\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"그것은 \n                                        약해서 작은 물건을 드는 것도 </span></font>\n</p><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">힘듭니다.\"</span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td height=\"28\" width=\"56\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">0-9</span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"28\" width=\"247\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"무척 \n                                        둔해보입니다.\"</span></font></p></td>\n<td height=\"28\" width=\"225\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"그것은 \n                                        조금 허약해 보입니다.\"</span></font></p></td>\n<td height=\"28\" width=\"56\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">10-19</span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"28\" width=\"247\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"조금 \n                                        둔해 보입니다.\"</span></font></p></td>\n<td height=\"28\" width=\"225\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"그것은 \n                                        조금 약해 보입니다.\"</span></font></p></td>\n<td height=\"28\" width=\"56\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">20-29</span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"28\" width=\"247\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"민첩성은 \n                                        보통입니다.\"</span></font></p></td>\n<td height=\"28\" width=\"225\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"그것은 \n                                        보통 체력을 가진것 같아 보입니다.\"</span></font></p></td>\n<td height=\"28\" width=\"56\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">30-39</span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"28\" width=\"247\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"조금 \n                                        민첩해 보입니다.\"</span></font></p></td>\n<td height=\"28\" width=\"225\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"그것은 \n                                        약간 강해 보입니다.\"</span></font></p></td>\n<td height=\"28\" width=\"56\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">40-49</span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"28\" width=\"247\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"아주 \n                                        민첩해 보입니다.\"</span></font></p></td>\n<td height=\"28\" width=\"225\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"그것은 \n                                        매우 강해 보입니다..\"</span></font></p></td>\n<td height=\"28\" width=\"56\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">50-59</span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"28\" width=\"247\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"대단히 \n                                        민첩해 보입니다.\"</span></font></p></td>\n<td height=\"28\" width=\"225\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"그것은 \n                                        무척 강해 보입니다.\"</span></font></p></td>\n<td height=\"28\" width=\"56\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">60-69</span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"28\" width=\"247\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"엄청나게 \n                                        민첩해 보입니다.\"</span></font></p></td>\n<td height=\"28\" width=\"225\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"그것은 \n                                        엄청나게 강해 보입니다.\"</span></font></p></td>\n<td height=\"28\" width=\"56\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">70-79</span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"28\" width=\"247\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"번개같이 \n                                        빨라 보입니다.\"</span></font></p></td>\n<td height=\"28\" width=\"225\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"그것은 \n                                        황소처럼 강해보입니다.\"</span></font></p></td>\n<td height=\"28\" width=\"56\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">80-89</span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"28\" width=\"247\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"이렇게 \n                                        빠른건 처으 봅니다.\"</span></font></p></td>\n<td height=\"28\" width=\"225\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"그것은 \n                                        지금까지 본 것중에 강해 보입니다.\"</span></font></p></td>\n<td height=\"28\" width=\"56\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">90-99</span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"28\" width=\"247\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"초인적인 \n                                        빠르기입니다.\"</span></font></p></td>\n<td height=\"28\" width=\"225\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"그것은 \n                                        초인적으로 강합니다.\"</span></font></p></td>\n<td height=\"28\" width=\"56\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">100+</span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:20px;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>1</b>.상대방의 현재 \n                            민첩과 체력을 알수 있게 하는 \n\n            스킬입니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:20px;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>2</b>.만약 해부학(아나토미)스킬을 사용하여 목표물을 조사를 \n                            해봅시다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:20px;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">목표물이 \n                            덱스 100과 체력 100을 지니고 있다면 다음과 같은 \n                            메시지가 보이게 될 것입니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:20px;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"</span></font><font color=\"purple\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">그것은 \n                            초인적으로강하고, 초인적인 빠르기입니다</span></font><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:20px;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>3</b>.스킬의 성공여부와 \n\n                관계없이 스킬수치에 따라 최대 20%까지 적에게 \n\n                추가 데미지를 입힐 수 있습니다</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:20px;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>4</b>.아나토미스킬 65이상부터 \n\n                상대방의 스테미나를 볼 수 있습니다</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:20px;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"</span></font><font color=\"purple\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">이것의 스테미너가 \n                            거의 100퍼센트입니다.\"</span></font><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> <br></span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:20px;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">이표시는 상대방의 스테미너가 100%로 \n\n                        차있다는 표시입니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:20px;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>5</b>.힐링과 연관된 스킬로서 \n\n                부활이나 독치료 힐을 할수 있게 해줍니다</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:20px;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;자세한 정보는 힐링(Healing)스킬란에서 \n\n                보시길 바랍니다.</span></font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" bordercolordark=\"#A0965A\" bordercolorlight=\"#999933\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"298\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:8;\"><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_skill/\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/menu.gif\" width=\"30\"></font></span></b></a></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"295\">\n<p align=\"right\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"#top\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/top.gif\" width=\"20\"></font></span></b></a></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Written By Forg</span></b></font></p>\n<p align=\"right\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/memo_b.gif\" height=\"20\" width=\"630\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;<img border=\"0\" height=\"15\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/b_logo.gif\" width=\"100\"></span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n"
}
